t return `nullptr`. Thus this test is not necessary. If `ProfileIOS` is not null, then `prefService` cannot be null either. And if `ProfileIOS` is null (or…"],["ed7eaae8_92b9ab7a",27,-6,1,"Don't depend on those targets, instead depend on `//ios/chrome/app/strings` directly. ``` deps = [ \"//components/infobars/core\", \"//components/strings\", \"//ios/chrome/app/strings\",…"],["7f93fb8d_2922d2bf",15,0,0,"In the future, let's add these screenshots as attachments directly to the bug to keep this open to non-google contributors. Then you can link to those attachments here instead of using screenshot…"],["ddd497cf_c616bcd8",28,0,1,"Remove period?"]],0,43]]}